## Status lifecycle

`open` → `fixed — awaiting re-test` → `verified` (re-tested `PASS` on revision X) — or `won't fix` only with the user's recorded decision.

## Re-test history

| Round | Revision | Cases rerun | Result |
|---|---|---|---|

Earlier rounds stay in the report; a later `PASS` does not erase an earlier `FAIL`.

